<section class="cxx entity object">
<h1 id="Arcadia_StringBuilder">Arcadia_StringBuilder</h1>
<p>Mutable, valid UTF-8 text, including embedded U+0000. Codepoint indices are zero-based and are not byte offsets or grapheme indices. Keep the builder rooted while using borrowed storage; callers must not modify its fields or borrowed bytes. Invalid ranges, invalid types, malformed UTF-8 and allocation failures are rejected before changing contents. Self-insertion and self-replacement use pre-mutation contents. Codepoint arrays must contain Unicode scalar values; a zero count permits NULL. Prefix and suffix queries compare raw bytes. Create an independent immutable snapshot with <code>Arcadia_String_create(thread, Arcadia_Value_makeObjectReferenceValue((Arcadia_Object*)builder))</code>.</p>
</section>

