<section class="cxx entity method">
<h1 id="Arcadia_StringBuilder_compareTo">Arcadia_StringBuilder_compareTo</h1>
<pre><code>Arcadia_Integer32Value
Arcadia_StringBuilder_compareTo
  (
    Arcadia_Thread* thread,
    Arcadia_StringBuilder* self,
    Arcadia_Value other
  );</code></pre>
<p>Compare unsigned UTF-8 bytes lexicographically. A proper prefix sorts first. Accepts RuntimeUTF8String, String and StringBuilder.</p>
</section>

