<section class="cxx entity method">
<h1 id="Arcadia_StringBuilder_toUpperASCII">Arcadia_StringBuilder_toUpperASCII</h1>
<pre><code>void
Arcadia_StringBuilder_toUpperASCII
  (
    Arcadia_Thread* thread,
    Arcadia_StringBuilder* self,
    Arcadia_SizeValue* index,
    Arcadia_SizeValue* length
  );</code></pre>
<p>Convert ASCII lowercase letters within the specified codepoint range. Null index means zero; null length means through the end.</p>
</section>

