<section class="cxx entity method">
<h1 id="Arcadia_StringBuilder_endsWith_pn">Arcadia_StringBuilder_endsWith_pn</h1>
<pre><code>Arcadia_BooleanValue
Arcadia_StringBuilder_endsWith_pn
  (
    Arcadia_Thread* thread,
    Arcadia_StringBuilder* self,
    void const* bytes,
    Arcadia_SizeValue numberOfBytes
  );</code></pre>
<p>Test whether the stored bytes end with the given byte sequence. A zero byte count always returns true, including when <code>bytes</code> is NULL. A nonzero byte count with a NULL pointer raises <code>Arcadia_Status_ArgumentValueInvalid</code>.</p>
</section>

<section class="cxx entity method">
<h1 id="Arcadia_StringBuilder_startsWith_pn">Arcadia_StringBuilder_startsWith_pn</h1>
<pre><code>Arcadia_BooleanValue
Arcadia_StringBuilder_startsWith_pn
  (
    Arcadia_Thread* thread,
    Arcadia_StringBuilder* self,
    void const* bytes,
    Arcadia_SizeValue numberOfBytes
  );</code></pre>
<p>Test whether the stored bytes start with the given byte sequence. A zero byte count always returns true, including when <code>bytes</code> is NULL. A nonzero byte count with a NULL pointer raises <code>Arcadia_Status_ArgumentValueInvalid</code>.</p>
</section>

